{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","血毒之羽"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","血毒の羽根"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标敌人造成大量持续伤害，每次造成伤害时根据已损失生命值造成一定比例的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵1体に大量の持続ダメージを与え、ダメージが発生するたびに、追加で対象のHP減少量の一定割合分のダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","翼对目标敌人施加“血毒之羽”，持续10秒。“血毒之羽”持续期间，目标每秒受到翼60% + 8% ATK的基础伤害，并且附带目标当前已损失生命值5%的额外伤害。额外伤害最高不超过翼100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体に10秒間の「血毒の羽根」を付与。「血毒の羽根」の持続期間中、対象は毎秒、デゼルの60% + 8% ATKの基礎ダメージと対象自身のHP減少量×5%の追加ダメージを受ける。追加ダメージはデゼルの100% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":89,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":108,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至65% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","毎秒の基礎ダメージがデゼルの65% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至70% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","毎秒の基礎ダメージがデゼルの70% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至75% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","毎秒の基礎ダメージがデゼルの75% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","毎秒の基礎ダメージがデゼルの80% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","利爪穿刺"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","穿つ鋭爪"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成少量伤害，同时使其受到持续伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵に少量のダメージを与え、さらに持続ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","翼将手刺入敌人胸口，造成70% ATK的伤害，拔出时再次造成70% ATK的伤害并撕裂其伤口，使目标在后续5秒内每秒受到翼120% + 20% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","爪で敵の胸を貫き、70% ATKのダメージを与え、爪を抜く時に再度、70% ATKのダメージを与え、敵の傷を抉る。傷を抉られた対象は5秒間、毎秒デゼルの120% + 20% ATKのダメージを受ける"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":30,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":76,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","刺击造成的伤害增加至75% ATK，后续每秒造成的的伤害增加至140% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","敵の胸を貫く時のダメージが75% ATKにUPし、傷を抉られた対象が毎秒受けるダメージが140% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","刺击造成的伤害增加至80% ATK，后续每秒造成的的伤害增加至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","敵の胸を貫く時のダメージが80% ATKにUPし、傷を抉られた対象が毎秒受けるダメージが160% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","刺击造成的伤害增加至85% ATK，后续每秒造成的的伤害增加至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","敵の胸を貫く時のダメージが85% ATKにUPし、傷を抉られた対象が毎秒受けるダメージが180% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","蚀命羽咒"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","侵食の呪詛"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","记录敌人受到的持续伤害，累计值满时爆发造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵が受けた持続ダメージを記録し、記録した値が一定値に達するたびに、対象に大ダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","翼在战斗开始时会飞向敌方阵营并让全部敌人受到“蚀命羽咒”的影响，飞行过程中自身处于无敌状态。\n 受到“蚀命羽咒”影响的敌人护甲和魔抗降低20%，在受到持续伤害时会将伤害记录为诅咒值。每当诅咒值累计达到其最大生命值20%时或者翼初始攻击力的400%时，诅咒爆发，对该敌人造成其最大生命值25% + 4%的伤害，爆发造成的伤害最高不会超过翼600% + 90% ATK。每名敌人诅咒爆发每3秒最多触发一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、敵サイドへ飛び、敵全体に「侵食の呪詛」を付与。飛行中、自身は無敵状態になる\n 「侵食の呪詛」状態の敵は物理・魔法防御-20%、持続ダメージを受けた時、そのダメージが呪詛値として記録される。呪詛値が「対象のHP上限×20%」または「デゼルの初期攻撃力×400%」に達するたびに、呪詛が炸裂し、対象の敵にそのHP上限×25% + 4%のダメージを与える。呪詛炸裂によるダメージはデゼルの600% + 90% ATKを超えない。また、同じ敵の呪詛炸裂は3秒ごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":145,"end":150,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":172,"end":178,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":166,"end":171,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":201,"end":207,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":75,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dotDmg"},{"start":168,"end":182,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":69,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dotDmg"},{"start":197,"end":211,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","诅咒爆发时，造成的最大生命值的伤害提升至30% + 4%，伤害最高不会超过翼700% + 90% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","呪詛炸裂によるダメージが対象のHP上限×30% + 4%にUP。呪詛炸裂によるダメージはデゼルの700% + 90% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","诅咒爆发时，造成的最大生命值的伤害提升至35% + 4%，伤害最高不会超过翼800% + 90% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","呪詛炸裂によるダメージが対象のHP上限×35% + 4%にUP。呪詛炸裂によるダメージはデゼルの800% + 90% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","诅咒爆发时，造成的最大生命值的伤害提升至40% + 4%，伤害最高不会超过翼900% + 90% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","呪詛炸裂によるダメージが対象のHP上限×40% + 4%にUP。呪詛炸裂によるダメージはデゼルの900% + 90% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+12%"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+16%"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+20%"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","羽咒灵祭"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","呪詛の儀式"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时和携带“血毒之羽”的敌人被击败时回复能量，并使自身获得永久增伤。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","「侵食の呪詛」が炸裂する時、または「血毒の羽根」を持つ敵が撃破された時、自身のSPを回復し、自身の与ダメージが永続的にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时翼回复100能量，同时使自身造成的伤害永久提高6%，最多提高至36%。\n敌人被击败时若携带“血毒之羽”，则翼会将其回收，“血毒之羽”每剩余1秒持续时间，便使翼回复50能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「侵食の呪詛」が炸裂するたびに、自身のSPを100回復し、自身の与ダメージが永続的に+6%、最大で+36%まで\n「血毒の羽根」を持つ敵が撃破された時、その「血毒の羽根」を回収。回収した「血毒の羽根」の残りの持続時間1秒につき、自身のSPを50回復"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时自身造成伤害提升的最高值提升至42%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「侵食の呪詛」炸裂による与ダメージ上昇の上限が+42%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”爆发时造成伤害的85%转为真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「侵食の呪詛」炸裂によるダメージの85%を確定ダメージに変換"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时自身造成伤害提升的最高值提升至48%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「侵食の呪詛」炸裂による与ダメージ上昇の上限が+48%にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，扣除身前队友的生命值，使自身获得护盾和属性加成。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の前に配置された味方のHPが減少する代わりに、自身のステータスがUPし、シールドを獲得"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，翼夺取自己面前格队友的生命力，扣除其10%当前生命值，使翼获得30%攻击力加成以及30生命汲取，同时获得扣取生命值500%的护盾，最高不超过自身攻击力500%，持续到战斗结束。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の前方1マスに配置された味方の生命力を奪い、対象味方のHPが現在HP×10%分減少し、減少したHP×500%分の永続シールドをデゼルに付与（シールド値はデゼルの攻撃力×500%を超えない）、さらに永続的にデゼルの攻撃力+30%、ライフスティール+30"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","骨刺短匕"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","スパイクナイフ"]]}